msgstr "BiGame-mode aún no tiene un perfil para este juego. ¿Crear uno ajustado para esta máquina?"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:471
msgid "BiGame-mode has no profile for this game yet. This is the profile it would create, and why each value was chosen."
